WEBVTT

00:06:57.803 --> 00:07:00.386
and then the other is going
to do all the work for him.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.976
So it's what we call freeloading.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.015
(Laughter)

00:07:06.039 --> 00:07:08.855
But it shows the intelligence
that the elephants have.

00:07:08.879 --> 00:07:11.452
They developed several
of these alternative techniques

00:07:11.476 --> 00:07:13.434
that we did not approve of, necessarily.

00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:14.681
(Laughter)

00:07:14.705 --> 00:07:16.688
So the other elephant is now coming ...

00:07:19.746 --> 00:07:21.205
and is going to pull it in.